Value DISK_PCT (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value TOTAL_DISK_BYTES (\d+)
Value USED_DISK_BYTES (\d+)

Start
  # Matches the percentage row, whether it's an integer or decimal
  ^\|\s*${DISK_PCT}\s*\|
  # Matches the bytes row and triggers the record save
  ^\|\s*${TOTAL_DISK_BYTES}\(B\)\s*\|\s*${USED_DISK_BYTES}\(B\).* -> Record